/sandmodels paid --sort newest
/sandmodels all --recent 30 --tools --sort newest --explain
```

Lookout preserves OpenRouter's catalog-added timestamp and exposes two explicit
local discovery controls. `--recent DAYS` filters relative to the catalog snapshot
already loaded by this Pi process; `--sort newest` orders known timestamps newest
first while keeping unknowns last. Plain `/sandmodels` keeps its established
free-first, route-aware order.

The timestamp means **added to OpenRouter**, not original model release, training
chronology, provider readiness, or quality. Unknown evidence remains unknown. A
stale snapshot is disclosed and cannot contain models added after it; the picker
