Plain `sandpi` enters the persistent room and starts native Pi without imposing a
provider, model or conversation. `--RESUME` maps to Pi `--continue`; lowercase
`--resume` opens Pi's picker. Neither starts a benchmark. Provider words choose
only the initial Pi state and do not permanently brand the room. Bare-metal is
