## Process-local Pi intent

The room is persistent; launch intent is not. The base runtime carries only
room-global catalog, credential-bank and broker facts. Before each upstream Pi
exec, the guest wrapper creates a unique fixed-schema invocation record.

That distinction makes these commands independent:

```bash
