switching. GPT/Gemini never receive an automatic substitute. There is no Codex-to-
Pi transcript import. The native branch also carries a `sandpi.model-transport.v1`
entry. If the same provider/model ID resumes through a different Pi API, Sandpi
records and announces that transport migration instead of pretending the session
continued under identical provider semantics.

