Advertising tools and at least 8192 context tokens is necessary for automatic
coding selection, not sufficient evidence of competence. Text-only/no-advertised-
tools models can still be selected explicitly and run with no Pi tools. Image-only
offerings are not coding-agent text models. Unknown pricing
is not promised free merely to include every catalog entry.

