|---|---|---|
| Active | Yes | Yes, subject to grade/health/tools/context. |
| Expiring (today or within two days) | Yes, with visible status | No. |
| Unknown/malformed | Yes, with visible status | No. |
| Expired | No; omitted from the managed Pi provider | No. |

