```

This enters the same persistent project machine. It does not pick an expensive
model for you or run a qualification tournament. Use Pi's `/model` to select an
exact model. Priced models are loaded from the public OpenRouter catalog; prices
are not inferred from a model's name.

For a researched initial choice:

```bash
