sandpi --paid --preset kimi
sandpi --paid --preset claude
sandpi openrouter --paid --model VENDOR/EXACT_MODEL_ID
sandpi --RESUME --paid
```

The current presets are exact, revision-bound starting points—not rankings and
not permanently tuned moving aliases:

| Group | Presets |
|---|---|
| OpenAI | `gpt-sol`, `gpt-sol-pro`, `gpt-astra`, `gpt-astra-pro`, `gpt-luna` |
| Anthropic | `claude-fast`, `claude`, `claude-deep` |
| Google through OpenRouter | `gemini-or` |
| xAI and Mistral | `grok`, `mistral` |
| Kimi | `kimi`, `kimi-code` |
| GLM | `glm`, `glm-prime` |
| DeepSeek | `deepseek` |
| Qwen | `qwen`, `qwen-prime` |
| MiniMax | `minimax`, `minimax-m27` |

Run `sandpi presets --refresh` for the exact model IDs, reviewed canonical
