The correction applies to free and paid OpenRouter, using native Chat Completions
and Anthropic Messages. Key/group failover remains bounded by the existing
pre-output policy. Once assistant content or an externally observed raw event
has been delivered, no transparent replay is allowed. Partial responses and
already-received accounting remain available. Successful native length results,
cancellation settlement and tool effects are untouched.

There is no new operator command. Existing /keys, /sandroute, /sanddefaults and
