# Reviewed handoffs and evidence-first reviews

Rev0072 update: these dialogs now share admission with the other Sandpi picker,
handoff and note-editing workflows. See [dialog coexistence](PI-DIALOG-COEXISTENCE.md)
for scope and editor cancellation limits; earlier independent-gate descriptions
below are historical. Native/addon UI is not globally locked.

Introduced in rev0044 / Baton; working-set defaults updated in rev0054 / Bearings,
