| --- | --- |
| No explicit mode, or `--mode text`, with both host streams on terminals | TUI, PTY, inherited input, ordinary Pi-to-shell flow. |
| Text/default with either stream redirected, or explicit `--print`/`-p` | Print, no PTY, exit with Pi. |
| `--mode json` | JSON, no PTY, exit with Pi. |
| `--mode rpc` | RPC, no PTY, inherited long-lived protocol input. |

