| Layer | Responsibility |
|---|---|
| OpenRouter catalog normalization | Model ID, supported inputs, catalog context/output evidence, reasoning metadata and price data. |
| Sandpi recommendation | Existing bounded starting output ceiling: generic paid 32,768, free 8,192, then clipped by normalized context/model limits; an active exact-model recipe may set a different paid recommendation. |
