`--sort context` orders configured windows from large to small, not available
headroom or usable output. Combine with `--fits` for its distinct estimate.
Unknown sort values appear last rather than vanishing; ties retain the existing
order. Rate filters exclude unknown costs. Unknown context is still excluded by
