invalidate confirmation even when it would still pass the requested filter.
Other rows may become stale while a dialog is open; this is a snapshot list, not
a live re-sorting service. Selection always names and previews the exact candidate.

**Discovery filters are not OpenRouter endpoint `max_price` or provider `sort`.**
They do not alter request preferences, reserve credit, grant paid access, or enforce
a spending limit. Values are configured estimates, not an endpoint quote/invoice.
Cache, scheduled, endpoint-specific and non-token charges are outside these two
dimensions and may differ. A paid ID with a zero-valued native override is still a
