A host entry lease answers only “which host launcher still owns a terminal or
command inside this room?” It is not a conversation identifier and is never
inserted into model context. One entry can start a new Pi session, continue an
existing session, switch sessions, or leave Pi for the guest shell; the lease
remains tied to the host process until that entry exits.

