## Use the existing brief workflow

```text
/sandbrief fix the parser cancellation path; leave the public API unchanged
/sandbrief in about 150 words, carry only the next migration check and its blockers
/sandhandoff
```

The first two are examples of alternatives, not a sequence you must run. Arguments
