## Primary-source findings

**Request hooks are part of the native request.** Pi's types describe a payload
hook that can asynchronously replace the assembled payload, a response hook,
and a read-only parsed-provider-event observer. They also distinguish a
provider stream's error terminal from synchronous authentication setup errors.
