Rethrow its failure; do not repair or interpret it. Prefer local provenance at
the eventual error boundary, use existing neutral request accounting, and show
which hook failed. Keep actual cancellation and real provider errors on their
existing paths. This is a targeted Sandpi correction, not a new Pi fork.

