prompt-length tiers. Scheduled overrides stay in raw evidence. The Pi-facing
provider rejects missing or malformed cost metadata instead of defaulting paid
models to zero.

Completion receipts now require the native boolean settlement outcome. This is a
protocol migration, not a new session manager. Pi remains the only owner of its
