# Rev0045 research — arrival, not another control plane

Research date: 2026-10-08. Target retained: Pi 1.1.0 at commit
`abe508e1b89912adde45528136c3221eb69acdd7`. These are online primary-source findings,
separate from the attached rev0044 archive and this release's execution evidence.
