#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Real VM RPC transport acceptance without any model prompt or inference call.

Queues get_state before VM boot, requires a correlated response, then closes
stdin and verifies clean Pi -> VM teardown. Keep consuming LF-framed stdout.
